   1911  f5d5							; (tally gate + integration) drives the real pad path; tools/test_room_dark.py
   1912  f5d5							; pins the inline dark test against bank1's IsRoomDark split; test_key_pickup
   1913  f5d5							; slices the bank2 body for the type-6 / parked-ObjTop contracts.
   1914  f5d5							; ==============================================================================
