   2105  f6bb							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   2106  f6bb							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   2107  f6bb							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   2108  f6bb							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   2109  f6bb							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2110  f6bb							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2111  f6bb							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2112  f6bb							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2113  f6bb							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2114  f6bb							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
