   2941  fc8d							; (LoadLevel re-places the player — callers skip their stay action).
   2942  fc8d							; C=0: still alive — physics zeroed here; caller does its per-site stay
   2943  fc8d							; action (bar reload, RoomY shift). Tail-callable (`jmp LoseLife`).
