   3249  fda8							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3250  fda8							; ColOff/ColMask — cell-walk lookup tables (cell_collision_plan).
   3251  fda8							;   Indexed by LEFT-HALF source col 0-19 (PHM prologue mirrors right-half
   3252  fda8							;   ranges before the walk; bank2 display-space walkers mirror first too).
   3253  fda8							;   ColOff: byte offset from PF0Buf+row ($C3+row) to the register holding
   3254  fda8							;   that col (0/3/6 = PF0/PF1/PF2 row byte). ColMask: the col's bit in that
   3255  fda8							;   byte — PF0 bit4+col (cols 0-3), PF1 MSB-first (4-11), PF2 LSB-first
   3256  fda8							;   (12-19); matches convert_room.pf_values (plan 0.2 spec, proven by
   3257  fda8							;   tools/test_cell_map.py).
   3258  fda8							;   (The standalone CellSolid leaf that lived here moved INTO
   3259  fda8							;   PlayerHitsMap's walk as inline code — a jsr in the walk cost 2B of
   3260  fda8							;   stack depth and would break sim_bomb_fuse's gameplay min-SP >= $F8
   3261  fda8							;   guard; the post-pad slot keeps these tables abs,X-reachable.)
   3262  fda8							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
